        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"metaphysician\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/edb3f5/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> metaphysician:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>Quote:<br><blockquote>Wager Master - No opinion, I cannot play against him because of having cards that are different sizes.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\n&nbsp;???\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Earlier copes if Sentinels of the Multiverse have slightly bigger cards. Sinnce Wager Master has hero cards shuffled into his deck, it doesn't work.</p>",
