      {
        "id": 162781,
        "name": "Ronway",
        "username": "Ronway",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-20T14:33:06.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Katsue\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/katsue/48/2012_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Katsue:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<div><b>Ronway wrote:</b><br><blockquote>Grand Warlord Voss - Totally still play it, even if Advanced runs the risk of him playing one of his two ships, thus taking additional damage or destroying a Hero ongoing. It at least stops his normal play.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nAren't you running the risk of Forced Deployment ruining your day?\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Maybe, maybe not. It comes down to how many minions are in the trash. Plus, it wouldn't be any different than if it was left in play for a round without having the means of destroying it, other than it happens one round sooner.</p>",
